WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,760
we won't stay long

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:09,520
If the government does not have any effective rescue information in the short term

3
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,640
or instructions

4
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,480
Or the danger here increases.

5
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,720
we will leave

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,700
Keep going north of course

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,980
Do you want to follow me?

8
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,940
It is the free choice of each of you

9
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,780
Stay or go together

10
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,940
Or you can have other plans

11
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,420
Survival is the only goal now

12
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:30,020
Everyone has the right to choose the path they think is best for survival

13
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:34,730
As for the time we are here, we will not cast it in vain.

14
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,620
We will find food and water on our own

15
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,740
Clean up the surrounding area

16
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:40,810
Responsible for vigilance

17
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:44,050
You don’t have to worry that we will use up your few reserves.

18
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:46,160
Or cause unnecessary trouble

19
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,040
In fact, we don’t come to this house very often.

20
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,560
This time I took advantage of the vacation to take care of the children

21
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,680
As a result, how much food is left in the pantry?

22
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,800
We don't entirely know either

23
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,040
Wang Yi was in charge before.

24
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,880
If there is any left we can share it

25
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:56,800
This place is so big

26
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,520
It is indeed safer to have more people

27
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,400
Just in case something happens

28
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:03,040
I hope everyone can help each other

29
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:06,200
If you want to survive under the hands of those things, you just have to hide.

30
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,080
The strength of one or two people is not enough

31
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,120
Trust takes time, cooperation requires rules

32
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:11,960
But now at least one thing is clear

33
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:14,880
Regardless of the speculation in the past, everyone will die faster if they fight against the epidemic.

34
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:16,960
Under this roof, you have to put your strength in one place

35
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,960
Be alert and look for supplies to deal with possible dangers

36
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,840
Everyone has to be useful and responsible
